      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Guard cones: green sees nothing, amber is suspicious, red is chasing you.

    Sneak
    near guards and dogs. Sprinting and thrown stones can be heard from far off.

    Torchlight
    gives you away. Walls and shadows hide you; a shadow-step makes you nearly invisible.

    A
    thrown stone draws a guard from his post. The harp calms one who has only heard
    something.

    David follows you. Leave him waiting in cover, then run him to
    the next golden marker.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1a35e19143a0a204d96c0ff5bdc7c375, type: 2}
